        "headline": {
          "en": "Dimir Goryo's",
          "zh": "蓝黑怨灵"
        },
        "order": 1,
        "positioning": {
          "en": "The overall structure resembles Grixis Goryo's: Unearth brings back Abhorrent Oculus, while two-mana reanimation targets the large threats. Without red for Faithless Looting, the deck uses Hedron Crab and Stitcher's Supplier for self-mill and gives up interaction entirely to focus on its own plan. That allows it to play eight large reanimation targets, with Ulamog often ending the game in a single attack. Agatha's Soul Cauldron can exile Griselbrand to turn counters into card draw, while exiling the deck's large creatures also ensures Ulamog enters with counters. The sideboard is straightforward, with almost every card played as a four-of and each matchup target clearly defined.",
          "zh": "整体结构有点像格利极掘坟，出土大眼加2费掘大哥。只不过没有红色的丧信掠夺，加了晶石蟹和拼接师备尸自磨。并且完全放弃了互动，专注自己的计划。所以要掘大哥的目标加到了八张，钨拉莫很多时候可以一脚直接爆头。而大锅可以吃棘泽边抓牌，还可以放逐大哥让钨拉莫进场有豆。备牌也是组的很简洁，基本都是满编，要打谁非常明确。"
        },
        "subtype_id": null,
        "supporting_facts": []
      }
