  "weekly_summary": {
    "items": [
      {
        "deck_links": [],
        "order": 1,
        "text": {
          "en": "This week featured the second the Hobbits themed Modern Spotlight Series, held in Dallas with 921 players. Izzet Prowess again won the event. Prowess was the most-played strategy at both Super Qualifiers and won both, although its advanced performance metrics were not the strongest. Full data is available through the Tabletop Major Events tab above.",
          "zh": "本周是第二场霍比特人主题的摩登MS，在美国达拉斯举办，921名牌手参赛，最终又由红蓝灵技席卷。连续两场MS都是灵技整体占比最高，并最终夺冠。不过高阶数据方面，灵技都并不是最出色的。详细数据可以在点击上方“实体大赛”标签查看。"
        }
      },
      {
        "deck_links": [],
        "order": 2,
        "text": {
          "en": "The metagame remains wide open. Even Prowess, the most-played deck at both Spotlights, only just exceeded 10%. And no MTGO deck has consistently stayed above a 10% high-finish share. Across the four-week average, however, Esper Blink and Esper Goryo's—both Esper strategies—have posted comparatively higher Top 8 conversion rates.",
          "zh": "整体环境持续保持开放，两场MS上占比最高的灵技也只是刚刚过10%。而MO的高分占比同样是没有能稳定过10%的套牌。不过从四周平均来看，艾斯波云移和艾斯波怨灵两套艾斯波色组的牌八强的转化率都是相对更高的。"
        }
      },
