        "text": {
          "en": "A Dimir Goryo's list reached one final and another Top 8: deck:5c191e64b5866f5771ac. Its structure resembles Grixis Goryo's, using Unearth for Abhorrent Oculus and two-mana reanimation for its larger threats. Without red for Faithless Looting, it instead uses Hedron Crab and Stitcher's Supplier for self-mill, abandoning interaction entirely to focus on its own game plan.",
          "zh": "一套蓝黑色组的怨灵套牌可以拿下一个亚军和另外一个八强：deck:5c191e64b5866f5771ac。整体结构有点像格利极掘坟，出土大眼加2费掘大哥。只不过没有红色的丧信掠夺，加了晶石蟹和拼接师备尸自磨。并且完全放弃了互动，专注自己的计划。"
